1
00:00:00,755 --> 00:00:03,925
(Howard:)Did you send everyone to
the principal's office already?

2
00:00:05,593 --> 00:00:07,293
(Sheldon:)No one signed up.

3
00:00:07,295 --> 00:00:09,065
(Leonard:)Well, that's not your fault.

4
00:00:09,063 --> 00:00:12,433
(Sheldon:)I called the department
secretary to see what happened.

5
00:00:12,433 --> 00:00:16,273
(Sheldon:)Apparently, I have a reputation
for being obnoxious.

6
00:00:17,238 --> 00:00:19,638
(Leonard:)What?

7
00:00:20,675 --> 00:00:22,745
(Raj:)Hey, Sheldon, I'm sorry.

8
00:00:22,744 --> 00:00:24,844
(Sheldon:)No, it's fine.

9
00:00:24,846 --> 00:00:29,146
(Sheldon:)Now I can devote all my time
to dark matter.

10
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:32,150
(Raj:)Aw, you brought cookies
for everyone?

11
00:00:32,153 --> 00:00:33,553
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes. Fig Newtons.

12
00:00:33,554 --> 00:00:36,324
I was going to ask them:
which scientist both helped

13
00:00:36,324 --> 00:00:39,764
(Sheldon:)to develop calculus and had
a famous cookie named after him?

14
00:00:39,761 --> 00:00:41,131
(Sheldon:)And then after
someone said "Newton,"

15
00:00:41,129 --> 00:00:43,399
(Sheldon:)I was going to tell them
they're wrong.

16
00:00:45,099 --> 00:00:48,199
(Sheldon:)The cookies are named
after a town in Massachusetts.

17
00:00:48,202 --> 00:00:50,932
(Sheldon:)And then I'd throw
the cookies away.

18
00:00:52,673 --> 00:00:54,573
(Howard:)Hey, what if I took your class?

19
00:00:55,543 --> 00:00:57,573
(Sheldon:)Why would you do that?

20
00:00:57,578 --> 00:01:00,018
(Leonard:)Yeah, why would you do that?
What's wrong with you?

